{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "038tak_402_2_4_038_02_09_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:3c101133f9d234a8975e3500193db635a0c9ba1de5231d7e7c527b5c92beac4f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:038tak_402_2_4_038_02_09_b:2_4_038_02_09_b:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8fc89b847c07c40966ff062069bd3b310ba0414e3ae94c776151aba0f30d9f62",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，辛苦了。\n我现在正来取点篝火用的柴木。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:038tak_402_2_4_038_02_09_b:2_4_038_02_09_b:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:761dc4d5444c50e5eb1baffb9c66e6087be8bea75b2c09c1154dd36b111d2e35",
      "text": "能帮我看看还要多少才够吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:038tak_402_2_4_038_02_09_b:2_4_038_02_09_b:cmd-000012:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:91b8987c0bfa2269edf393d98f9637e75ebdd6c7d0daa6b597a95bacfb3dd9fc",
      "text": "大概一捆左右",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:038tak_402_2_4_038_02_09_b:2_4_038_02_09_b:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02bc37dcb2ca13d37873e4d4aa821c3ce5440772d27796a5e0695ad9efc17215",
      "text": "明白了。那人手就完全够用了。\n我现在搬过去，你们在那边等着就好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:038tak_402_2_4_038_02_09_b:2_4_038_02_09_b:cmd-000017:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63db56a190e54906475b7ee571384ecc207a934eac721af4316f207ba689587c",
      "text": "让您忙来忙去真不好意思",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:038tak_402_2_4_038_02_09_b:2_4_038_02_09_b:cmd-000018:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:136758c5b175da3e1cbd6b08e190caa7d207cb698754b9d7ef43772f34e5f27e",
      "text": "会不会很重？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:038tak_402_2_4_038_02_09_b:2_4_038_02_09_b:cmd-000022:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7011592e818cb7a4c27a1586af363564cb8bd60ce571fcc9ea56382aba69a53f",
      "text": "这种程度根本算不上什么。\n倒不如说当成运动刚刚好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:038tak_402_2_4_038_02_09_b:2_4_038_02_09_b:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98d5779b80b9ac16258920bd59c6cc06a706ad9d272db89183d0dfc52e169382",
      "text": "而且，难得体验一次露营。\n凡事亲力亲为去体验才算数吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:038tak_402_2_4_038_02_09_b:2_4_038_02_09_b:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e6b0f6a22439c49a5767d30ce0357a967656596297aee84b7c0510d62663ab2",
      "text": "话又说回来，这个露营地什么都准备得好齐备啊。\n小孩子也能轻松玩得很尽兴。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:038tak_402_2_4_038_02_09_b:2_4_038_02_09_b:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38fecd02593fa7b07616f00419f1d37ecca0a3ee21b80d7af3d0e3e1a94b434d",
      "text": "那我先挂了。马上回你那边去。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
